      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_book",
      "text": "You become the book inside you. You recite it, slowly, to children. They learn it. They will, in time, recite it to other children.",
      "sceneTitle": "Becoming Ecclesiastes",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Becoming Ecclesiastes"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_writer",
      "text": "You and Granger, eventually, write a new book together. It is, mostly, a list of the books that were lost. It becomes the seed of a recovered library.",
      "sceneTitle": "Writer",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Writer"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_river",
      "text": "You stay by the river. You teach the people who pass. You light no fires you don't need. You die very old, with a small book in your hands that nobody burned.",
